o makes sure that those who are dead remain dead and stay in their proper realms. Even though he's had this job for over 70 years, he is in the worst division with horrible pay. He also has a knack for not keeping partners (since shinigami work in pairs), but now he seems to have one that will stick around; stubborn, smart-mouthed, serious and defensive 16 year old, Kurosaki Hisoka. With each case they investigate, they come closer to the conspiracies of the serial killer Dr. Muraki Kazutaka. Tsuzuki's relationship with Hisoka is growing stronger and closer...but there is a dark past to how Tsuzuki died that will not give him peace.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Magic","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Afterlife","rank":85,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Shoujo","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Detective","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Psychosexual","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Boys' Love","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rape","rank":55,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Anti-Hero","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Office","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Curses","rank":33,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Disability","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Vampire","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Descendants of Darkness","english":"Descendants of Darkness","native":"闇の末裔","romaji":"Yami no Matsuei","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"暗之末裔"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"爱上坏坏的死神"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"愛上壞壞的死神"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"闇之末裔"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"死神来了"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"死神來了"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}